{{!-- The journey — MY story, in one frame. Six stops on one road:
graduate, Accenture, Cognizant, Twilio, Education First, and the
reader's own turn. No sideways scroll — the road runs the width
of the content column, the stops share it in a grid, and the
whole chapter reads at a glance. On a tablet the grid folds, on a
phone the road turns vertical down the left edge.

Every card opens with a picture slot (.story-media) and closes
with the tags of that chapter. The slots hold the theme's branded
placeholder until the real photos arrive: drop an image at
assets/images/journey/{year}.jpg and replace the placeholder
partial inside the span with an img tag pointing at it through
the asset helper — nothing else changes.

The animation is CSS, armed by the reveal observer (data-animate
→ .is-in from animate.js): the road fills from the first stop to
"Now", each station lights as the fill reaches it, each card rises
a beat after its station. No scroll coupling, nothing to measure;
with reduced motion or no script the frame is simply lit.

The dates come from the resume (Accenture 03/2018, Cognizant 08/2021,
Twilio 07/2022, Education First 05/2026, B.E. 2013–2017). Keep
journey-stacked.hbs in step when a chapter changes. --}}
<section class="section outer home-story">
    {{!-- A quiet blueprint grid behind the road — the band is light,
    the same alternating ground every other section uses, so the
    timeline reads as part of the page rather than a poster. --}}
    <div class="story-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="inner relative">
        <div class="section-head" data-animate>
            <div>
                <span class="kicker">{{> "icons/map-icon"}} {{t "The journey"}}</span>
                <h2>{{t "From graduate to Salesforce GTM engineer"}}</h2>
                <p>{{t "The road so far — every stop taught something that ended up as a lesson here."}}</p>
            </div>
            {{#get "pages" filter="slug:about" limit="1" as |about|}}
                {{#if about.[0]}}
                    <a class="btn story-head-cta" href="{{about.[0].url}}">
                        {{t "Read my story"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}
                    </a>
                {{/if}}
            {{/get}}
        </div>

        <ol class="story-frame" data-animate>
            {{!-- The road, and the accent fill that travels it up to
            "Now" — the fifth of six stops, so --story-reach is 4/5 of
            the way from the first node to the last. --}}
            <span class="story-road" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>

            <li class="story-stop" style="--i: 0;">
                <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/graduation-cap"}}</span>
                <div class="story-card">
                    <span class="story-media" aria-hidden="true">{{> "thumb-placeholder" icon="graduation-cap"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "The start"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2017">2017</time>
                    <h3>{{t "Engineering graduate"}}</h3>
                    <p>{{t "B.E. Computer Science, LNCT Bhopal. A degree, an inbox full of applications, and the will to learn anything."}}</p>
                    <span class="story-chips" aria-label="{{t "Tags"}}"><span>B.E. CSE</span><span>Bhopal</span></span>
                </div>
            </li>

            <li class="story-stop" style="--i: 1;">
                <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/zap"}}</span>
                <div class="story-card">
                    <span class="story-media" aria-hidden="true">{{> "thumb-placeholder" icon="zap"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "First break"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2018-03">2018</time>
                    <h3>Accenture</h3>
                    <p>{{t "Salesforce Engineer. CRM Analytics for trade promotion and telecom — datasets, SAQL, bindings, first Sales Cloud reporting."}}</p>
                    <span class="story-chips" aria-label="{{t "Tags"}}"><span>CRM Analytics</span><span>SAQL</span><span>Sales Cloud</span></span>
                </div>
            </li>

            <li class="story-stop" style="--i: 2;">
                <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/layers"}}</span>
                <div class="story-card">
                    <span class="story-media" aria-hidden="true">{{> "thumb-placeholder" icon="layers"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "Scale"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2021-08">2021</time>
                    <h3>Cognizant</h3>
                    <p>{{t "CRM Analytics Consultant. Enterprise clients, dashboards rebuilt for speed — owning delivery end to end."}}</p>
                    <span class="story-chips" aria-label="{{t "Tags"}}"><span>Dashboards</span><span>Consulting</span><span>Delivery</span></span>
                </div>
            </li>

            <li class="story-stop" style="--i: 3;">
                <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/signal"}}</span>
                <div class="story-card">
                    <span class="story-media" aria-hidden="true">{{> "thumb-placeholder" icon="signal"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "GTM era"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2022-07">2022</time>
                    <h3>Twilio</h3>
                    <p>{{t "Salesforce GTM Engineer. CRM Analytics for Sales Ops — pipeline, funnel, forecast, CPQ — and the first time I met the word GTM."}}</p>
                    <span class="story-chips" aria-label="{{t "Tags"}}"><span>Sales Ops</span><span>CPQ</span><span>Forecast</span></span>
                </div>
            </li>

            <li class="story-stop is-now" style="--i: 4;" aria-current="step">
                <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/cloud"}}</span>
                <div class="story-card">
                    <span class="story-media" aria-hidden="true">{{> "thumb-placeholder" icon="cloud"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag"><i class="story-now-ping" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{t "Now"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year" datetime="2026-05">2026</time>
                    <h3>Education First</h3>
                    <p>{{t "Salesforce Engineer in Budapest, moving reporting from Qlik to CRM Analytics — and writing every lesson down here."}}</p>
                    <span class="story-chips" aria-label="{{t "Tags"}}"><span>Qlik → CRMA</span><span>Agentforce</span><span>Budapest</span></span>
                </div>
            </li>

            <li class="story-stop is-next" style="--i: 5;">
                <span class="story-node" aria-hidden="true">{{> "icons/avatar"}}</span>
                <div class="story-card">
                    <span class="story-media is-open" aria-hidden="true">{{> "thumb-placeholder" icon="avatar"}}</span>
                    <span class="story-tag">{{t "Your turn"}}</span>
                    <time class="story-year is-open">{{t "Next"}}</time>
                    <h3>{{t "You?"}}</h3>
                    <p>{{t "Start your own Salesforce chapter — the courses are free and the path is mapped."}}</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-sm story-cta" href="{{@site.url}}/training/">{{t "Start here"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</a>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>
